OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny showers
OL,6,Fwill clear to leave a mainly dry
OL,7,Fevening. The rest of the night will
OL,8,Fthen remain dry across all parts with
OL,9,Fsome clear periods. Turning rather
OL,10,Fchilly.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FA dry and bright morning with
OL,13,Fsunny intervals, with increasing areas
OL,14,Fof cloud. Then a dry afternoon with
OL,15,Fsunny intervals turning hazier at
OL,16,Ftimes.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
