OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FBecoming widely unsettled from Monday,
OL,7,Fwith rain spreading northwards, at
OL,8,Ftimes heavy and persistent. Further
OL,9,Fspells of rain or showers are likely
OL,10,Fon Tuesday and Wednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
